==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 12~14 seconds<sup>360f~420f</sup>.
**2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 14~16 seconds<sup>420f~480f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use only meatshields and [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] like [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], along with heavier hitters like [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]].

Send a [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] every few seconds while upgrading the Worker Cat. After reaching Worker LV.8 and saving 10,000¢, send in Valkyrie and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], then [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] after a while. Keep spawning Dragon Cats until you beat the stage.

